Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Jagirinawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's definitely the Jagirinawa, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake Cutter, Snake Rope, or Snake Cutter Rope
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.77,0:00:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's occasionally called the Serpent, also.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Serpent? So it's a snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino, what kind of aberration is the Jagirinawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an aberration that moves according to one's ill will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.01,0:00:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not just ill will alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}but when someone calls the Jagirinawa, I can't really think of it as anything but ill will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah. I heard about that from Sengoku, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who put the curse on her was her classmate's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's a pretty well-known curse among middle schoolers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Hmm... The Jagirinawa isn't really something that can be controlled by amateurs...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}But anyway, why did her classmate's friend want to curse the little lady in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it was about romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy the girl liked confessed to Sengoku,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.57,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but Sengoku rejected him, unaware of the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and became resented.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.59,0:01:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.03,0:01:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After Sengoku found out that she was cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,she started reading books about snake curses,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,looking into the way to lift the curse, and performed the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.18,0:01:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Killing a snake to release a snake curse seems pretty sketchy to me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.51,0:01:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's more, her situation's gotten worse since she started killing snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Araragi-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,chopping up snakes to counter the Jagirinawa isn't wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.53,0:01:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She messed up the procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.64,0:01:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lifting a curse is harder than casting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With an amateur level of knowledge, the situation is bound to get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, she was really unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd it go, Araragi-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. We can release Sengoku from her curse with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.45,0:03:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we can erase the scale marks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.58,0:03:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we want to remove the curse, we have to do it at that shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to be safe, we should do it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku, is it okay if you go home late tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's fine. I'll tell my mom that I'm staying at a friend's house tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need several other things for the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go get them. In the meantime, you go call your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.69,0:04:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there might be a lot of stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so could you come with me, Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't act tonight, it'll threaten her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Jagirinawa has taken the form of an invisible snake, and it's constantly constricting her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The scale marks are the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}According to Oshino, if the scales reach her face, she can't be saved anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:05:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's constricting her, then shouldn't Sengoku-chan be in pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino said it should hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She's probably just holding it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That classmate didn't have to go so far just because
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku-chan rejected the boy she liked...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No. The curse itself isn't anything special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Actually, the curse shouldn't even have activated, since it was cast by an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems she made a mistake while trying to break the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She was also pretty unlucky, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}The shrine where the little lady slaughtered the snakes used to be an insignificant place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That was before Shinobu-chan came...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.98,0:05:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,along with the noble blood of the legendary vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.11,0:05:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of aberrations: the vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, all sorts of bad things started gathering at that shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:06:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's also why you weren't feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.21,0:06:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Yeah, the Jagirinawa activated because she slaughtered the snakes in that shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If she hadn't done it there, everything would've been fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really like Sengoku-chan hurt herself with her own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't it be dangerous to do the ceremony in that shrine again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.39,0:06:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No. If we follow the procedure correctly, it'll bring out the Jagirinawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So it'll actually benefit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sengoku...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Koyomi-oniichan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those scale marks... They actually hurt, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.85,0:07:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A-About that... Please don't get mad, Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.18,0:07:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm not mad or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if you're okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It does feel like I'm being squeezed, but it's not unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking that you have to hold it in is weird in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.99,0:07:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If it hurts, it's okay to say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Just getting tied up is no big deal, but staying tied up for a while is surprisingly hard on your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.71,0:07:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no clue why you'd say being tied up isn't a big deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,or why you completely ignored her mental pain, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Sengoku...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}You said there was a boy who confessed to you... Why did you turn him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.57,0:08:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,there's already someone else I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan, how much do you remember from back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest... not very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My memory's not all too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.59,0:09:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, you really remembered me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.97,0:09:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because I didn't really get along with others very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, the only one I could play with after school was Rara-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.78,0:09:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Rara-chan? You mean Tsukihi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.70,0:09:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rara-chan and I ended up going to different middle schools later,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}but those times of playing with you and Rara-chan are my most precious memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I'm an only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really jealous that she had an older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru, are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm prepared this time, so it's not as bad as I thought it'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.74,0:10:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru, I did tell you to bring clothes that would make it easy to see if
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the scale marks were gone or not, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.09,0:10:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would you be carrying around a school swimsuit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to match it up with your preferences...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To hell with your matching!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I notice you don't deny this is your preference.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit in the middle, on the sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.31,0:10:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the charm tightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes, breathe steadily, and then you can start praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Praying? To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To whatever. Maybe, in this situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.49,0:10:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan, make sure you watch, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch over me carefully, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.47,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch me, Koyomi-oniichan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in sixth grade, but you're not scary at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't pick on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you're really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You even fixed my bike for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.69,0:12:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,not...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.65,0:12:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rara-chan's so lucky, having such a nice brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I call you... Koyomi-oniichan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.49,0:12:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's finally breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.50,0:13:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,now you're in debt to Oshino-san again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.33,0:13:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With something this strong, it's going to be a pretty high price, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah. This time, there's no debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Kanbaru, remember when I told you that this was turning into a place where evil things gather?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Such places are dangerous, because they could turn into a spiritual world war at the drop of a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,By putting that charm on the shrine, we nipped that in the bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He said that charm was pocket change in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This removal ceremony sure takes a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:14:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree, but all we can do is wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Araragi-senpai, Sengoku-chan is already really worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just pull the Jagirinawa off in one go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino said that I should be able to touch it and even pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, the Jagirinawa will undoubtedly attack you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm able to get away from it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll just go back to the classmate who placed the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So basically, "What goes around comes around."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.47,0:14:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.97,0:14:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"What goes around comes around."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, I'm repeating myself, but remember that saying and really think about what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.61,0:14:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really know what you're thinking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but someday, I'm going to leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:15:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When that happens, I won't be able to give you advice anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aberrations aren't the type to get involved with humans on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}But you're the type of person that jumps in, even when you should leave something alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.67,0:15:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But if it comes to my attention... I just can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.55,0:15:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just act like I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it have been better if you just forgot everything like your class rep?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgetting everything is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.89,0:15:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that was a bit mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}We're pretty good friends now, so I'm not just going to disappear without saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an adult, you know. I know the right thing to do, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.28,0:15:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}But since you're already thinking about your future, I think it'd be good to think about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Basically, what you're saying is that my desire to help people is immature, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But Oshino, I can't be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm one-tenth vampire -- an aberration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:16:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't become someone who exterminates them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Araragi-kun, if you abandon Shinobu-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you can turn back to a normal human being again whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.85,0:16:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.19,0:16:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know. Suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we mess up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.83,0:16:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We messed up, didn't we, Araragi-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.06,0:16:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru, I misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were just able to see the Jagirinawa, it would've been completely obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:17:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There wasn't just one Jagirinawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.87,0:17:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There were two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It wasn't just the girl who used to be her friend that held a grudge against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.19,0:17:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.60,0:17:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy she rejected held a grudge, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.11,0:17:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I can't see it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be able to touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.87,0:19:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This might just work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.16,0:19:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Even if you can't see the Jagirinawa, they still leave traces when they move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is listen for moving dirt and watch for parting grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can estimate its location.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.03,0:19:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.34,0:20:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.29,0:20:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down! Don't get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.67,0:20:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get excited, the poison will spread, Araragi-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Snakes are fierce animals, but they're cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.43,0:20:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you leave it alone, it'll just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kanbaru, if I do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.93,0:20:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that snake will just go back to that boy Sengoku turned down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.86,0:20:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't forget who you're trying to save...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.97,0:20:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I want to follow it, chasing invisible snakes is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:20:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,impossible for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.93,0:21:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry... for putting you in such a tough situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.36,0:21:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.69,0:21:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't apologize. It was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.12,0:21:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kanbaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.79,0:21:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The snakes are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They've gone back to those who called them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with the curses they carried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.19,0:21:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru made the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}For a half-assed aberration like me, standing up to a real aberration is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:22:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan, thanks for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.79,0:22:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't say that, Sengoku. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.67,0:22:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve your gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.38,0:22:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I did something unthinkable, and tried to save even the guy who cursed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.94,0:23:56.65,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.65,0:23:57.45,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.45,0:24:00.66,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,Its about time to expose just who we are and introduce ourselves properly!{she actually says formal introduction}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.66,0:24:03.20,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,It's too late! It's past too late! It's been far too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.20,0:24:06.50,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,I wonder how many of them are wondering just who is who!{This is the joke}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.50,0:24:07.37,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Probably everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.37,0:24:10.08,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,I am Araragi Karen! Araragi Koyomi's little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.08,0:24:12.54,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,I am Araragi Tsukihi! Araragi Koyomi's little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.54,0:24:14.09,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,A third year student in middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.09,0:24:15.84,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,A second year student in middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.84,0:24:17.92,Default,Tsukihi&Karen,0,0,0,,Together we're the Fire sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.68,0:24:20.68,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,Just kidding! I was Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:22.47,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Just kidding! I was Karen!{yes, past tense... and thug just happens to be same}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.55,0:24:24.18,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,We switched just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.18,0:24:25.68,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,We switched just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.68,0:24:26.98,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,I wonder if you fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.98,0:24:28.14,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,You fell for it didn't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.14,0:24:29.98,Default,Tsukihi&Karen,0,0,0,,Next time! Tsubasa Cat Part 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.98,0:24:31.31,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,Now, which one am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.31,0:24:32.48,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Preview Quiz!
